## Phase 3: Forecasting & Logistics Build

**Duration:** 6 weeks (Weeks 13–18)  
**Dependency:** Phase 2 complete; baseline data available

### Objectives
- Build AI forecasting module v1: harvest timing and sell-now-vs-wait recommendations
- Implement payment tracking and mobile money integration (stub → real)
- Build transport request and coordination flows
- Add trust/rating indicators

### Workstream 1: AI Forecasting Module

| Component | Requirements | Owner | Duration | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Data Pipeline | Ingest historical prices, weather data, seasonal patterns | Data/ML lead | 2 weeks | Clean and normalize price data; align with weather timeseries |
| Harvest Timing Model | FR-3.1: Recommend harvest timing based on price/weather forecast | ML engineer | 2 weeks | Linear regression or similar; input: weather 14–30 days ahead; output: confidence % |
| Sell-Now-vs-Wait Model | FR-3.2, FR-3.3: Recommend selling price and window | ML engineer | 1.5 weeks | Compare predicted future price vs. current spoilage risk |
| Confidence/Risk Indicator | FR-3.5: Show confidence level and risk factors for each recommendation | ML engineer | 1 week | E.g., "60% confidence; risk: data unavailable for last 2 weeks" |
| API Endpoint | `/api/forecasts?cropType=&location=&harvestDate=` | Backend eng. | 1 week | Call forecasting service; cache results for 24 hrs |
| Validation | Test recommendations against held-out historical data (20% test set) | Data/ML lead | 1 week | Target: recommendations correct ≥60% of the time |

**Deliverable:** `/api/forecasts` endpoint returning harvest timing and sell-now-vs-wait recommendations with confidence scores

### Workstream 2: Payment Tracking & Mobile Money

| Component | Requirements | Owner | Duration | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Transaction Data Model | FR-5.1, FR-5.2: Record payment obligations, status, reminders | Backend eng. | 0.5 weeks | Extend Phase 2 model with payment_status, due_date, reminders_sent |
| Mobile Money API Integration | FR-5.3: Real MTN MoMo (or AirtelTigo) Collections/Disbursements | Integration eng. | 2 weeks | Initiate payment from buyer; confirm via USSD PIN; settle to farmer account |
| Payment Reminder Service | FR-5.5: Remind overdue payers via SMS/USSD | Backend eng. | 1 week | Daily cron job; escalate after N days |
| Reliability Score | FR-5.4: Calculate buyer/farmer payment reliability based on history | Backend eng. | 1 week | E.g., "on-time payment rate: 95%" |
| Admin Payment Dashboard | View pending, in-progress, completed, overdue transactions | Frontend eng. | 1 week | Identify high-risk buyers/sellers for follow-up |

**Deliverable:** `POST /api/transactions/:id/pay` wired to real mobile money provider; payment reminders functional

### Workstream 3: Transport Coordination

| Component | Requirements | Owner | Duration | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Transport Request Model | FR-4.1, FR-4.2: Create transport request (origin, destination, produce type, date) | Backend eng. | 1 week | Extend Phase 2 model with location, vehicle type, capacity |
| Transport Request API | Submit/list/search transport requests | Backend eng. | 1 week | Buyers/farmers can request; transporters can browse |
| Transporter Assignment | FR-4.3: Transporter accepts request; farmer confirms | Backend eng. | 1 week | State machine: open → assigned → confirmed → in_transit → delivered |
| Shared Transport Pooling | FR-4.4: Match multiple nearby requests for the same route to reduce cost | Data/ML eng. | 1.5 weeks | Geo-clustering algorithm; cost savings calculation |
| Transport Cost Calculation | Display shared cost savings to farmers | Backend eng. | 0.5 weeks | E.g., "Save 30% by pooling with 2 other farmers" |

**Deliverable:** Transport request flows end-to-end; `/api/transport-requests` API and assignment flows

### Workstream 4: Trust & Ratings

| Component | Requirements | Owner | Duration | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Rating Model | FR-7.3: Farmers rate buyers/market sellers and vice versa | Backend eng. | 1 week | 1–5 stars; optional comment; aggregate average |
| Rating API | Submit/view ratings by user | Backend eng. | 1 week | `/api/users/:id/ratings` endpoint |
| Public Profile | FR-7.1: Display user profile with rating, transaction history summary | Frontend eng. (both app + web) | 1 week | Show on listing view (seller profile) and transaction confirmations |

**Deliverable:** Ratings and public profiles visible in mobile app and admin dashboard

### Phase 3 Exit Criteria
- ✅ Forecasting module produces harvest timing and sell-now-vs-wait recommendations with confidence levels
- ✅ Forecasting validated against historical test set with ≥60% accuracy
- ✅ Mobile money provider integration signed; real payment flows work in sandbox
- ✅ Payment reminders trigger correctly for overdue transactions
- ✅ Transport request submission, search, and assignment flows complete and testable
- ✅ Shared transport pooling algorithm tested with 10+ sample requests
- ✅ Rating submission and profile display verified in app and dashboard
- ✅ `/api/forecasts`, `/api/transactions/:id/pay`, `/api/transport-requests` endpoints operational

