- ✅ Performance targets met (USSD < 2 sec, API p95 < 200 ms)
- ✅ Usability testing complete; core flows completable by low-literacy users without facilitator help
- ✅ All documentation updated (README.md, API docs, deployment guide)
- ✅ Code frozen; no new features or architectural changes allowed before pilot

