## Phase 5: Pilot Launch

**Duration:** 2 weeks (Weeks 22–23)  
**Dependency:** Phase 4 complete; Phase 1 baseline data and partner MOUs in place

### Objectives
- Onboard pilot users (farmers, buyers, sellers, transporters)
- Deploy platform to staging environment in Central Region
- Activate support infrastructure
- Begin live data collection

### Workstream 1: User Onboarding

| User Class | Count | Method | Owner | Timeline |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Smallholder Farmers | 30–50 | In-person registration sessions at cooperative meetings | Field ops | Week 22 |
| Market Sellers | 15–20 | In-person at market association gathering or individual visits | Field ops | Week 22 |
| Institutional Buyers | 3–5 | Phone/in-person meetings; demo of platform | Field ops + Product | Week 22 |
| Transport Providers | 3–5 | In-person; vehicle details, rate card setup | Field ops | Week 22 |

**Onboarding Checklist per User:**
- Phone number verified (SMS PIN sent/received)
- User role and profile information captured
- Device type and language preference recorded
- First transaction or listing created (to validate flow)
- Support contact info shared (helpline, SMS, WhatsApp)

**Deliverable:** Onboarded user registry; device/language profile summary; first-use completion rate

