|---|---|---|---|
| Deploy to staging server (cloud or local) | Ops/Infra | 1 week | Regional latency acceptable for West Africa (< 500 ms round-trip) |
| Configure SMS/USSD gateway to point to staging | Integration eng. + MNO partner | 0.5 weeks | Test webhook; confirm messages route correctly |
| Configure mobile money sandbox (or live if pilot scale allows) | Integration eng. + payment provider | 0.5 weeks | Test end-to-end payment flow with small amounts |
| Set up admin operations dashboard (live monitoring, logs) | Ops | 0.5 weeks | Real-time view of transactions, errors, user activity |
| Set up data backup and recovery procedure | Ops | 0.5 weeks | Daily snapshots; restore procedure tested |

**Deliverable:** Staging environment live; all integrations tested; ops team trained

