## Phase 6: Pilot Operation & Monitoring

**Duration:** 12 weeks (Weeks 24–35)  
**Dependency:** Phase 5 complete; platform live with pilot users

### Objectives
- Run the platform live through at least one full tomato harvest cycle (typically 3–4 months in Central Region)
- Collect data on all success metrics
- Iterate on UX/bugs based on real usage
- Build case for scale-up or pivot

### Monitoring & Operations (Ongoing)

| Activity | Owner | Frequency | Key Metrics |
|---|---|---|---|
| System Health Dashboard | Ops team | Real-time | API uptime, USSD error rate, database status, payment gateway connectivity |
| Weekly Data Summary | Data eng. | Weekly | Listings created, pre-commitments, transactions, users onboarded (cumulative) |
| User Support Review | Field ops lead | Weekly | Open tickets, resolution time, top issues, escalations |
| Biweekly Stakeholder Call | Product + Field ops | Biweekly | Progress vs. plan, risks, quick wins, feedback from users and partners |
| Live Issue Triage | Eng. lead | Daily | P0/P1 issues; decide: fix immediately, schedule for next sprint, or document as known limitation |

