| Category | Owner | SLA | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| P0 (Platform Down, Data Loss) | Eng. on-call | 1 hour response, 4 hour fix | E.g., database corruption, payment gateway integration broken |
| P1 (Major Feature Broken, Payment Stuck) | Eng. | 4 hour response, 24 hour fix | E.g., farmer cannot list produce, buyer pre-commitment not persisted |
| P2 (Minor UX Issue, Slow Response) | Eng. | 24 hour response, 1 week fix | E.g., form takes 5 sec to load, error message unclear |
| P3 (Enhancement, Nice-to-Have) | Eng. | Backlog | E.g., sort listings by distance, export transaction history |

**Deliverable:** Bug fixes deployed to staging weekly; critical fixes to production within SLA

