### Workstream 3: Data Monitoring Against Success Metrics

| Metric | Baseline (Phase 1) | Target for Pilot | Data Source | Frequency |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Post-Harvest Loss (farmer reported) | ~30–40% | < 25% | Survey (mid-cycle, end-of-cycle) | 2x during pilot |
