| Payment Delay Incidents | 25–30% of sales | < 10% | Transaction data (overdue count) | Daily (automated) |
| Completed Transactions | Baseline: 0 (pre-pilot) | ≥ 50 | API transactions table | Daily |
| Repeat Usage Rate | N/A (new platform) | ≥ 60% of users repeat within 4 weeks | User session data | Weekly |
| Forecast Accuracy | N/A | ≥ 60% recommendations lead to profitable sales | Survey + transaction review | End-of-cycle |
| Transport Cost Savings (farmers using shared transport) | Baseline from interviews (~GHS 50–80 per farmer) | Average 20% savings | Transport request data | Weekly (summary) |

**Deliverable:** Weekly dashboard showing progress toward each metric; mid-cycle and end-cycle reports

### Phase 6 Exit Criteria
- ✅ Platform operational for 12 weeks with > 95% uptime (excluding scheduled maintenance)
- ✅ At least one full harvest cycle data collected (farmers planted → harvested → sold → payment received or outstanding)
- ✅ ≥ 50 completed end-to-end transactions (from listing to payment) across all user types
- ✅ Post-harvest loss metric collected from at least 20 farmers; trend analysis completed
- ✅ Payment delay incidents reduced to < 10% (from baseline ~25–30%)
- ✅ ≥ 60% of users repeat use within 4 weeks
- ✅ Forecast recommendations validated (sample of 20+ recommendations reviewed for outcome)
- ✅ Support team handled all P0/P1 issues within SLA
- ✅ Usability improvements deployed and validated (e.g., form completion time reduced, user satisfaction score improved)
- ✅ All pilot data consolidated into evaluation report template (ready for Phase 7 analysis)

